1
00:00:00,392 --> 00:00:02,662
(Amy:)Uh, mostly Penny's
heard them.

2
00:00:04,496 --> 00:00:07,226
(Zack:)Boy, you get some
dirty looks over there

3
00:00:07,232 --> 00:00:09,262
(Zack:)when you ask for ice.

4
00:00:10,035 --> 00:00:12,635
(Raj:)Zack, this is
my friend Claire.

5
00:00:12,637 --> 00:00:15,137
(Zack:)You're hot. You seeing anybody?

6
00:00:15,140 --> 00:00:17,240
(Raj:)Uh, she's seeing me.

7
00:00:17,242 --> 00:00:18,472
(Zack:)Why'd you say she's your friend?

8
00:00:18,476 --> 00:00:19,706
(Raj:)We're just
keeping it casual.

9
00:00:19,711 --> 00:00:21,941
(Zack:)Why is he being casual with you?
You seem great.

10
00:00:21,946 --> 00:00:23,346
(Claire:)I don't know. Ask him.

11
00:00:23,348 --> 00:00:25,718
(Zack:)Why are you being casual
with her? She seems great.

12
00:00:33,658 --> 00:00:36,028
(Leonard:)Maybe we should
take a step back.

13
00:00:36,027 --> 00:00:37,557
(Howard:)Take a step back?

14
00:00:37,562 --> 00:00:39,662
I'm not a young man anymore.

15
00:00:41,066 --> 00:00:44,566
(Leonard:)No, I mean reevaluate what we're
doing with the guidance system.

16
00:00:44,569 --> 00:00:47,139
But (chuckles) I got a baby
on the way.

17
00:00:47,138 --> 00:00:48,708
(Howard:)I got to make some money.

18
00:00:48,706 --> 00:00:50,236
(Leonard:)What good is
money gonna do

19
00:00:50,241 --> 00:00:51,941
(Leonard:)if we inadvertently
bring about Armageddon?

20
00:00:51,943 --> 00:00:53,713
(Howard:)Okay, let me stop you
right there.

21
00:00:53,711 --> 00:00:54,941
(Howard:)We absolutely know

22
00:00:54,946 --> 00:00:58,046
(Howard:)our invention will not be used
to destroy the world.

23
00:00:58,049 --> 00:00:59,119
(Bernadette:)How?

